    dct:description "Docstring, sigma_discrete, mode_growth_table, and the Lean theorems (diffusion gate, N=5, N=0 at 200 nm, 1 mm successor gap) name the same integers. The Lean kernel was not run. Turing 1952 is not pinned to a page facsimile." ;
