    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 0.9999999973 against a reference of 1 (not equal), RMSE = 3.668e-05 /s against a 0.05 screening tolerance, KS = 0.087. Specimen foreground 0.181, circularity 0.096, and coherency 0.580 are measured on the photograph and stored against different reference placeholders. Spot count 32 is not the lattice expectation 25. Orientation KS between photograph and GIF is 0.059. Pixel identity of the sorocarp with the spot field is not claimed." ;
